  17:     - Foreground objects are solid monochrome rectangles touching a grid corner.
  18:     - Exactly one foreground color appears as multiple separate 4-connected objects; other colors appear once.
  19: 
  20:     Rule:
  21:     - Clear the multiple objects of the repeated color from their original positions.
  22:     - For each cleared rectangle, translate it away from the row and column border it touches by exactly its height and width.
  23:     - Keep singleton-color objects unchanged; overlapping translated rectangles of the same color merge.
  24: 
